 perfusion in the clinic and a model system for new strategies</article-title><source>Lancet Oncol</source><year>2003</year><volume>4</volume><fpage>429</fpage><lpage>437</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Lancet Oncol||4|429||bib8|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12850194</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Eggermont</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name><name><surname>Schraffordt</surname><given-names>KH</given-names></name><name><surname>Klausner</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Eggermont</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name><name><surname>Schraffordt Koops</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Klausner</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Kroon</surname><given-names>BB</given-names></name><name><surname>Schlag</surname><given-names>PM</given-names></name><name><surname>Lienard</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>van Geel</surname><given-names>AN</given-names></name><name><surname>Hoekstra</surname><given-names>HJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Meller</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Nieweg</surname><given-names>OE</given-names></name><name><surname>Kettelhack</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Ben-Ari</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Pector</surname><given-names>JC</given-names></name><name><surname>Lejeune</surname><given-names>FJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Isolated limb perfusion with tumor necrosis factor and melphalan for limb salvage in 186 patients with locally advanced soft tissue extremity sarcomas. The cumulative multicenter European experience</article-title><source>Ann Surg</source><year>1996a</year><volume>224</volume><fpage>756</fpage><lpage>764</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Ann Surg||224|756||bib9|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8968230</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Eggermont</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name><name><surname>Schraffordt</surname><given-names>KH</given-names></name><name><surname>Lienard</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Kroon</surname><given-names>BB</given-names></name><name><surname>van Geel</surname><given-names>AN</given-names></name><name><surname>Hoekstra</surname><given-names>HJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Lejeune</surname><given-names>FJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Isolated limb perfusion with high-dose tumor necrosis factor-alpha in combination with interferon-gamma and melphalan for nonresectable extremity soft tissue sarcomas: a multicenter trial</article-title><source>J Clin Oncol</source><year>1996b</year><volume>14</volume><fpage>2653</fpage><lpage>2665</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Clin Oncol||14|2653||bib10|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8874324</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hoving</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Brunstein</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>aan de Wiel-Ambagtsheer</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>van Tiel</surname><given-names>ST</given-names></name><name><surname>de Boeck</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>de Bruijn</surname><given-names>EA</given-names></name><name><surname>Eggermont</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name><name><surname>ten Hagen</surname><given-names>TL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Synergistic antitumor response of interleukin 2 with melphalan in isolated limb perfusion in soft tissue sarcoma-bearing rats</article-title><source>Cancer Res</source><year>2005</year><volume>65</volume><supplement>10</supplement><fpage>4300</fpage><lpage>4308</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Cancer Res||65|4300||bib11|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15899822</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hoving</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Seynhaeve</surname><given-names>AL</given-names></name><name><surname>van Tiel</surname><given-names>ST</given-names></name><name><surname>aan de Wiel-Ambagtsheer</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>de Bruijn</surname><given-names>EA</given-names></name><name><surname>Eggermont</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name><name><surname>ten Hagen</surname><given-names>TL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Early destruction of tumor vasculature in tumor necrosis factor-alpha-based isolated limb perfusion is responsible for tumor response</article-title><source>Anticancer Drugs</source><year>2006</year><volume>17</volume><fpage>949</fpage><lpage>959</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Anticancer Drugs||17|949||bib12|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16940805</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kort</surname><given-names>WJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Zondervan</surname><given-names>PE</given-names></name><name><surname>Hulsman</surname><given-names>LO</given-names></name><name><surname>Weijma</surname><given-names>IM</given-names></name><name><surname>Westbroek</surname><given-names>DL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Incidence of spontaneous tumors in a group of retired breeder female brown Norway rats</article-title><source>J Natl Cancer Inst</source><year>1984</year><volume>72</volume><fpage>709</fpage><lpage>713</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Natl Cancer Inst||72|709||bib13|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">6583455</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lienard</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Lejeune</surname><given-names>FJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Ewalenko</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>In transit metastases of malignant melanoma treated by high dose rTNF alpha in combination with interferon-gamma and melphalan in isolation perfusion</article-title><source>World J Surg</source><year>1992</year><volume>16</volume><fpage>234</fpage><lpage>240</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'World J Surg||16|234||bib14|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1561804</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Nooijen</surname><given-names>PT</given-names></name><name><surname>Manusama</surname><given-names>ER</given-names></name><name><surname>Eggermont</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name><name><surname>Schalkwijk</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Stavast</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Marquet</surname><given-names>RL</given-names></name><name><surname>de Waal</surname><given-names>RMW</given-names></name><name><surname>Ruiter</surname><given-names>DJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Synergistic effects of TNF-alfa and melphalan in an isolated limb perfusion model of rat sarcoma: a histopathological, immunohistochemical and electron microscopical study</article-title><source>Br J Cancer</source><year>1996</year><volume>74</volume><fpage>1908</fpage><lpage>1915</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Br J Cancer||74|1908||bib15|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8980389</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>O'Byrne</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Steward</surname><given-names>WP</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The role of chemotherapy in the treatment